WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.904
Forkcast brings recipes, meal planning, pantry
stock, and shopping into one

2
00:00:05.904 --> 00:00:11.409
local kitchen. Here is the workflow, with
practical artificial intelligence features

3
00:00:11.409 --> 00:00:15.412
and a chance to review changes before saving.

4
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.910
Start with fifty sourced recipes, real
photographs, and halal notes. Search

5
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:32.420
the collection, read the ingredients, and check
the original publisher. You

6
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:37.931
can also keep your own family recipes in the
private household

7
00:00:37.931 --> 00:00:38.432
database.

8
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.665
Read a pantry note from an image using your
configured model.

9
00:00:46.665 --> 00:00:50.931
The extracted stock is a preview. Check the
names and amounts,

10
00:00:50.931 --> 00:00:55.196
then save the reviewed items so the shopping
list can use

11
00:00:55.196 --> 00:00:56.747
what you already have.

12
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:08.472
Bring in a cooking video from its available
description or captions.

13
00:01:08.472 --> 00:01:13.544
The model prepares an editable recipe, keeping
the original link. Review

14
00:01:13.544 --> 00:01:18.616
the ingredients, make your own changes, and save
it to your

15
00:01:18.616 --> 00:01:19.077
collection.

16
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:29.052
Ask the assistant to prepare a weekly plan using
your saved

17
00:01:29.052 --> 00:01:33.704
recipes. Read the proposed changes before
applying them. The plan is

18
00:01:33.704 --> 00:01:38.356
saved only after you choose Apply, and it
remains editable in

19
00:01:38.356 --> 00:01:39.202
the planner.

20
00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:51.101
Turn the active plan into an aisle-grouped
shopping list. Pantry amounts

21
00:01:51.101 --> 00:01:56.802
are deducted, model interpretation can clarify
ingredient names, and recipe evidence

22
00:01:56.802 --> 00:02:02.503
shows where the quantities came from. Uncertain
amounts remain visible for

23
00:02:02.503 --> 00:02:03.021
review.

24
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.683
Review extracted flyer offers and compare whole-
pack costs, including any unpriced

25
00:02:12.683 --> 00:02:18.965
items. These prices are illustrative examples. A
separate location search shows

26
00:02:18.965 --> 00:02:24.677
actual mapped stores, without inventing stock or
current retailer prices.

27
00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:32.780
Use the responsive phone layout to check off
groceries, export the

28
00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:38.159
list, and keep a shopping history. Everything
saved belongs to your

29
00:02:38.159 --> 00:02:43.539
local household. For the complete step-by-step
session, follow the longer walkthrough

30
00:02:43.539 --> 00:02:44.517
linked below.
